@startuml
' UC17 - Xem danh sách học liệu
autonumber "<b>0.</b> "
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam MaxMessageSize 200

' AS-IS evidence; paths are relative to the workspace root.
' UC/BR: docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_UseCase.docx (UC17) and
' docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_QuyTacNghiepVu.docx (BR-79, BR-86, BR-147, BR-288).
' Both documents have core revision 1; their business release version is unidentified.
' Requested docs/ documents are under docs/uml/docs/; docs/source-of-truth is absent.
' UI: frontend/src/pages/instructor/course.builder.materials.tsx:282 (CourseBuilderMaterials).
' Display: same file:110 (columns), :176 (MaterialsContent), :193 (distinct file IDs).
' Route: frontend/src/router.tsx:457, :459 and :493; Instructor-protected Builder child.
' API: frontend/src/services/course.service.ts:115 (fetchCourseLessonDetailAPI).
' Wrapper imports courseAxios at :1; there is no separate materials-list request.
' Axios: frontend/src/services/axios.customize.ts:47, :61 and :64.
' URL: frontend/src/config/env.ts:13; frontend/.env.development:10 = http://localhost:8080.
' Vite dev command: frontend/package.json:7; env loading: frontend/vite.config.ts:11.
' No frontend .env/.env.local/.env.development.local or process URL overrides were found.
' Gateway: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/resources/application.yml:2 and :40.
' Bootstrap: services/course-service/src/main.ts:40 (api prefix and URI version 1).
' Controller: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.controller.ts:144.
' Service: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.service.ts:803.
' Repository: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.repository.ts:723.
' Prisma: services/course-service/src/infrastructure/prisma/prisma.service.ts:10.
' Models: services/course-service/prisma/schema.prisma:18, :31, :67, :84, :104 and :126.
' Local Course DATABASE_URL selects course_db; credentials are not included.
' Runtime reachability and deployment-mode overrides have not been verified.

actor Instructor
boundary "Learning Materials Page" as Screen
participant ":ApiGateway" as Gateway
participant ":CoursesController" as Controller
participant ":CoursesService" as Service
participant ":CoursesRepository" as Repository
database "course_db" as CourseDB

' Preconditions: authenticated Instructor; the parent Course Builder is already loaded.
' JWT middleware and token refresh are outside this ordinary protected UC.
' LayoutInstructorCourse:42 initially loads structure; :65 refetches Assessment
' assignments on pathname changes for the shared outline. Those shell interactions
' do not supply this material list and are excluded, rather than assumed absent.

activate Instructor
Instructor -> Screen: Open Lesson materials\n/instructor/courses/{courseId}/builder/lessons/{lessonId}/materials
activate Screen
Screen -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/lessons/{lessonId}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Controller: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/lessons/{lessonId}\nTrusted userId, organizationId, role
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: findLessonDetail(user, courseId, lessonId)
activate Service
Service -> Service: Verify Instructor and organization context
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Access checked successfully
  ' Query scope: Lesson.id and organizationId, Module.courseId and organizationId,
  ' Course.organizationId and Course.chain.instructorId. Materials and their files
  ' follow relations; the nested selections have no separate organization predicate.
  ' The read does not reject Locked, Submitted or disabled content.
  Service -> Repository: Load assigned Lesson and materials\nCurrent organization and instructor
  activate Repository
  Repository -> CourseDB: Read Lesson and ordered materials\nInclude MediaFile metadata
  activate CourseDB
  ' Prisma lesson.findFirst selects materials ordered by position ASC, including
  ' id, title, materialType, isRequired, fileId, position and disabledAt.
  ' File metadata includes originalFilename, mimeType, sizeBytes, durationSeconds,
  ' wordCount, status and releasedAt. No storage URL or file bytes are selected.
  CourseDB -->> Repository: Lesson with materials, or no match
  deactivate CourseDB
  Repository -->> Service: Scoped Lesson result
  deactivate Repository

  alt Lesson found successfully
    ' Service returns the actual detail payload, including Course/Module/Lesson
    ' context and materials. BigInt sizeBytes becomes a decimal string.
    Service -->> Controller: Lesson context and material metadata
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 200 OK - Lesson details
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Lesson context and material metadata
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -> Screen: Count materials and sum distinct file sizes
    activate Screen
    ' MaterialsContent: Set<fileId> deduplicates only this Lesson's references.
    ' totalSizeBytes uses BigInt; invalid or negative byte strings contribute zero.
    ' Individual rows still display their own referenced file size.
    deactivate Screen

    alt Materials loaded successfully\nNon-empty list
      Screen -->> Instructor: Show ordered materials, requirements and sizes\nShow counts and distinct attached-file total
    else Materials loaded successfully\nEmpty list
      ' A valid Lesson with materials=[] is a 200 success, not a missing Lesson.
      Screen -->> Instructor: Show no learning materials\nCounts and attached-file size are zero
    end
  else Lesson lookup failed
    ' Restore the original caller executions for this alternative.
    activate Gateway
    activate Controller
    activate Service
    ' Missing Lesson, mismatched Course, other tenant or different chain owner
    ' all return 404; no material data is returned to the screen.
    Service -->> Controller: Lesson not found
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 404 Not Found
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Material list load error
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show load error and Try again
  end
else Access check failed
  activate Gateway
  activate Controller
  activate Service
  ' A non-Instructor or absent organizationId is rejected before querying the DB.
  Service -->> Controller: Access denied
  deactivate Service
  Controller -->> Gateway: 403 Forbidden
  deactivate Controller
  Gateway -->> Screen: Material list load error
  deactivate Gateway
  Screen -->> Instructor: Show load error and Try again
end
deactivate Screen
deactivate Instructor

' The Table uses the returned material order, no pagination and no client type filter.
' Video/Reading counts are derived locally. Other materialType strings are not
' explicitly filtered by the query or Table; the UI has a generic icon fallback.
' Status priority: File released, Disabled, non-Ready file status, otherwise Ready.
' Disabled materials and released/non-Ready files remain listed and counted.
' BR-79: reading is scoped to the assigned Instructor and organization.
' BR-147: isRequired belongs to Material. The shared detail API also derives
' lesson.required from materials.some(isRequired); no Lesson/Module flag is stored.
' BR-86 concerns changing material titles (UC17.3), not this read-only operation.
' BR-288: attached-file total deduplicates by fileId within the current Lesson.
' It is not organization Subscription usage or a cross-version storage calculation;
' no organization-wide quota aggregation or deduction is executed in this UC.
' No separate per-version file-copy or double-counting step is invented.
' The shared API returns introduction text, but this screen uses only Lesson context
' and material metadata. It does not initiate UC16 as another user interaction.
' Add Video/Add Reading navigation exists on the page, but those actions, edit/delete,
' file downloads, storage calls and Learner progress are outside this UC.
' findLessonDetail calls no TenantClient, LearningClient, storage provider or Kafka.
' Technical UUID validation (400), transport and persistence failures are summarized
' as the same load-error UI rather than extra business alternatives.
' Error caveat: axios.customize.ts:37 resolves HTTP error bodies. This page then
' throws a plain Error for missing data; useApiQuery -> toApiError converts it to
' status 0. Its specialized 404 Alert is not reached by this normal HTTP-error path.
' Missing route IDs issue no request. Try again reloads the same query; aborted
' queries are ignored and do not display results for a previously selected Lesson.
@enduml
